<!-- 5. How the Process Works -->
<section class="sec" id="process">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="eyebrow">Clear, Honest Process</p>
      <h2>How We Work Together</h2>
      <p class="muted">Gathering decades of historical records can feel overwhelming. We handle the heavy lifting while keeping you informed every step of the way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps" style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>1. Discovery Consultation</h3>
          <p>A friendly 15-to-30 minute consultation with an experienced specialist. We learn where your family lived, their employment history, and documented medical conditions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>2. Immediate Honest Evaluation</h3>
          <p>We review covered counties, diagnosis dates, and statutory requirements. If we do not believe a claim qualifies, we give you a fast, direct answer rather than dragging things out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>3. Thorough Records Hunt &amp; File Assembly</h3>
          <p>We locate and compile vital historical documents: county residency records, historical census and school records, employment rosters, pathology reports, and certified death certificates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>4. Claim Filing &amp; DOJ Tracking</h3>
          <p>We assemble and submit a complete, airtight claim package to the Department of Justice before the statutory deadline, monitoring progress until payment is issued.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6. What Pricing Is Like (image_1.png highlights) -->
<section class="sec sec--band" id="pricing">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div class="fees-container">
      <div style="text-align:center">
        <span class="eyebrow">Transparent Pricing</span>
        <h2 class="fees-title">What Will It Cost To Process My Claim?</h2>
        <p class="fees-intro" style="max-width:72ch;margin:12px auto 0">
          Our fees are strictly regulated by the U.S. Department of Justice under federal statute. <strong>We do not collect our contingency fee until your claim has been approved and paid.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;width:100%">
        <ul class="fees-list">
          <li>
            <strong>New Claims:</strong> For new RECA claims, our fee is <strong>2%</strong> of the total compensation awarded.<br>
            <em>Example: For a Downwinder claim awarded $100,000, our fee is $2,000.</em>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Resubmitted Claims:</strong> If we are resubmitting a previously denied claim, the regulated fee is <strong>10%</strong> of the compensation awarded.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Administrative &amp; Processing Fees:</strong>
            <ul class="fees-sublist">
              <li>A non-refundable <strong>$200</strong> file review fee covers upfront administrative services, postage, and claim processing setup.</li>
              <li>A <strong>$400</strong> per claimant administrative processing fee is charged upon completion to help cover administrative costs incurred throughout the process.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Document Retrieval Fees:</strong> We obtain necessary records (such as medical pathology reports, historical presence documents, and vital records) on your behalf. These are billed per document, with payment not due until the claim has been fully processed.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="btns" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:var(--sp2)">
        <a class="btn" href="/pricing/">Read Full Fee Schedule</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/check/">Check Your Eligibility</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

